Project Title: Flameback Catering System (Project Group 12)

Authors: Hurrsh Misttry, Tetsuya Bassler, Alan Dickey

Description: Flameback Catering System is implementing a Python application for users to interact with 
the database without touching the actual SQL code that should only be contained in the Data Layer. This application 
aims to move away from the old processes of logging company data on paper and spreadsheet into a more 
efficient and easy to use system with a database and application for users to interact with.


